1409
01:07:55,370 --> 01:07:56,570
And it would do its thing.

1410
01:07:56,570 --> 01:07:58,315
Right?

1411
01:07:58,315 --> 01:07:58,940
So that was it.

1412
01:07:58,940 --> 01:08:03,140
It wasn't sort of
