1476
01:10:21,180 --> 01:10:22,992
I'm a big fan of simplicity.

1477
01:10:22,992 --> 01:10:24,450
It's easy to make
things that work.

1478
01:10:24,450 --> 01:10:27,480
I mean, I think it's a good
way to get things working.

1479
01:10:27,480 --> 01:10:30,360
